    <string name="help_notes_autosave_title">Auto-save</string>
    <string name="help_notes_autosave_description">
        Notes are automatically saved 2 seconds after you stop typing.
        The status indicator shows:
        • blue dot — unsaved changes
        • animated icon — saving in progress
        • green tick — saved successfully
        Your latest edits will not be lost even if the app closes or crashes.
    </string>

